# Day 15 - AI-Powered Life Analysis & Self-Reflection

## Overview

Today I explored how AI can be used for structured self-reflection and personal life analysis.

Instead of focusing on coding, dashboards, or career tools, I used AI to organize personal information and generate insights related to personality, career direction, financial habits, relationship patterns, and long-term growth opportunities.

The purpose was not prediction, but gaining a structured perspective on personal development and future planning.

---

## Objective

To understand how AI can assist with:

* Personal reflection
* Career planning
* Goal setting
* Identifying strengths and weaknesses
* Long-term growth analysis
* Structured decision-making

